---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/reading-hours-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/reading-hours-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="First-pass reading: 27 to 54 hours becomes 2 to 4"
  caption="Both are estimates. The 660 maybes still get read, after these and in order."
>
  Two bars. Reading all 816 applications by hand at two to four minutes each: 27 to 54 hours. Reading the 124 research notes at a minute or two each: 2 to 4 hours. Both are estimates, not yet measured.
</Chart>
